    {
      "ja": "昔々、中国に世界を創ったとされる優しい女神「女媧（じょか）」という偉い女王がいました。ある日、突然大きな音がして天の柱が折れ、地面が大きく割れました。空に穴が開き、火が燃え広がり、洪水の水が溢れて人々は大変な恐怖に包まれました。",
      "en": "Long, long ago, in China, there was a great queen and benevolent goddess named \"Jokwa\" who was said to have created the world. One day, suddenly a loud sound was heard, the pillar of heaven broke, and the ground cracked widely. A hole opened in the sky, fire spread, floodwaters overflowed, and people were engulfed in great terror.",
